// ............................................................................ 
// Quests
// ............................................................................ 

Q_GETACCESSCODES_S		Get the Warehouse Access Codes.
Q_GETACCESSCODES_L		Explore the streets of New York to gain information about the access codes.
Q_TRANSPONDER_S			Attach Transponder Uplink.
Q_TRANSPONDER_L			Find FBI CC Line #204 in the sewers beneath the city.
Q_USEACCESSCODES_S		Use Access Codes to Enter Warehouse.
Q_USEACCESSCODES_L		Use the Access Codes to enter the warehouse in the Docks Area of New York.
Q_FINDALEXANDRA_S		Find Alexandra.
Q_FINDALEXANDRA_L		Locate the Barclay South Storage Room and talk to Alexandra.
Q_FINDORSI_S			Find Orsi.
Q_FINDORSI_L			Find Orsi's office in the upper levels of the factory.
Q_INFILTRATEFACTORY_S	Infiltrate Orsi Factory.
Q_INFILTRATEFACTORY_L	Infiltrate Orsi's Factory in New York's Uptown.
Q_ENTERCATHEDRAL_S		Enter the Cathedral of Flesh.
Q_ENTERCATHEDRAL_L		Enter the Cathedral of Flesh hidden beneath an abandoned church in New York's Uptown.
Q_DESTROYVUKODLAK_S		Destroy Vukodlak.
Q_DESTROYVUKODLAK_L		Defeat the Tzimisce Methuselah Vukodlak in his Cathedral of Flesh.
Q_ORSIPENTHOUSE_S       Enter Orsi's Penthouse.
Q_ORSIPENTHOUSE_L       Find and gain entry into Orsi's Penthouse in the Barclay South located in New York's Uptown.


